  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dummy contract for co-organisation of event &#xbf;First among equals&#xbf; by the EU Delegation in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The event (&quot;First among equals&quot;) which will be supported by the EU Delegation to Uzbekistan aimed at creating a culture of female leadership in Uzbekistan, supporting the rights, initiatives and merits of women, as well as popularizing education among women and combating stereotypical thinking in society&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
